Test values
-----------

The simulator's default secrets ("ABCDEFGH", "UTILITYSECRET016",
"FIRMWARESECRET16"), keys (0x30..., 0x31..., 0x60..., 0x61... repeated),
system titles, serial numbers and readings are test values, not those of
any meter. Its signing and key agreement keys are generated at run time.
Do not use them on real meters.

